    {
      "id": "claim_dbd20f18d6a7400a8d319d141eae4a7e",
      "statement": "The recommended bootstrap layout splits the wiring into apps/<domain>/infrastructure/dependencies.py, framework.py (local bases plus config_framework that creates the instance and registers the dependencies before returning it) and an __init__.py that binds the instance first and only then imports the service modules, with the delayed import marked noqa E402.",
