    {
      "id": "claim_81f897ec1be84001b5396c207e3c77de",
      "statement": "The root-side read surface for adapters is framework.deps, which reads the instance's own dependency registry and does not require a built bus, whereas handlers read the same values as self.<name>; the README's consistency test exploits this by iterating DependencyContextType.__annotations__ and asserting each name is present in framework.deps.",
      "evidence": [
        {
          "resource": "repo://README.md#L496-L518",
          "version": "repo-lines-v1:sha256:c36179a0fbe0cc1944caa6d1448146e718861bd5f4c64d3417c74f78061ce280:"
